# Mods from Profiles: the made-up mod in the launcher's mods folder made a
# profile of its own on Your profile, the one in use after; Mods again,
# its row now its profile's; back to Profiles.
wait 1
expect home
find Profiles
key Return
wait 0.5
expect profiles
find Mods...
key Return
wait 0.5
expect mods
find TestMod
key Return
wait 0.5
expect import
find Make the profile
key Return
wait 0.8
expect home
find Profiles
key Return
wait 0.5
expect profiles
find Mods...
key Return
wait 0.5
expect mods
find Back
key Return
wait 0.5
expect profiles
quit
